{"id":"b830febc662345bf","group":"28","path":"28/28-df-boolean-formula.md","title":"Boolean Formula","display":"df-boolean-formula — Boolean Formula","type":"definition","metadata":{"book":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach","book_abbrev":"28","depends_on":[],"display":"df-boolean-formula — Boolean Formula","label":"28-df-boolean-formula","aliases":["28-df-boolean-formula"],"type":"definition","source_reference":"Arora–Barak, Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach, §2.3.1; local tagged syntax and recursion","source_printed_pages":"44–45","source_pdf_pages":"70–71","source_statement_verified":true,"source_proof_reviewed":false},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"book","html":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"28"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<span class=\"property-null\">无</span>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-boolean-formula — Boolean Formula"},{"key":"label","html":"28-df-boolean-formula"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>28-df-boolean-formula</span></div>"},{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Arora–Barak, Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach, §2.3.1; local tagged syntax and recursion"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"44–45"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"70–71"},{"key":"source_statement_verified","html":"true"},{"key":"source_proof_reviewed","html":"false"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb N=\\{0,1,2,\\ldots\\}\">\\(\\mathbb N=\\{0,1,2,\\ldots\\}\\)</span>；有序元组采用带类型标记的有限树编码。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PropVar},\\mathrm{BoolFml},(F_k)_{k\\in\\mathbb N}\">\\(\\mathrm{PropVar},\\mathrm{BoolFml},(F_k)_{k\\in\\mathbb N}\\)</span> 为本条构造的集合；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x_i,\\neg\\varphi,(\\varphi\\land\\psi),(\\varphi\\lor\\psi)\">\\(x_i,\\neg\\varphi,(\\varphi\\land\\psi),(\\varphi\\lor\\psi)\\)</span> 为其构造子记号。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"x_i\\coloneqq\\langle0,i\\rangle,\\qquad \\mathrm{PropVar}\\coloneqq\\{\\langle0,i\\rangle:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[x_i\\coloneqq\\langle0,i\\rangle,\\qquad \\mathrm{PropVar}\\coloneqq\\{\\langle0,i\\rangle:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\neg\\varphi\\coloneqq\\langle1,\\varphi\\rangle,\\quad (\\varphi\\land\\psi)\\coloneqq\\langle2,\\varphi,\\psi\\rangle,\\quad (\\varphi\\lor\\psi)\\coloneqq\\langle3,\\varphi,\\psi\\rangle.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\neg\\varphi\\coloneqq\\langle1,\\varphi\\rangle,\\quad (\\varphi\\land\\psi)\\coloneqq\\langle2,\\varphi,\\psi\\rangle,\\quad (\\varphi\\lor\\psi)\\coloneqq\\langle3,\\varphi,\\psi\\rangle.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"F_0\\coloneqq\\mathrm{PropVar},\\qquad F_{k+1}\\coloneqq F_k\\cup\\{\\neg\\varphi:\\varphi\\in F_k\\}\\cup\\{(\\varphi\\circ\\psi):\\varphi,\\psi\\in F_k,\\ \\circ\\in\\{\\land,\\lor\\}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[F_0\\coloneqq\\mathrm{PropVar},\\qquad F_{k+1}\\coloneqq F_k\\cup\\{\\neg\\varphi:\\varphi\\in F_k\\}\\cup\\{(\\varphi\\circ\\psi):\\varphi,\\psi\\in F_k,\\ \\circ\\in\\{\\land,\\lor\\}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{BoolFml}\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{k\\in\\mathbb N}F_k.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{BoolFml}\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{k\\in\\mathbb N}F_k.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>不同构造子的标签互斥，且有序元组编码可唯一解构；因此后续结构递归有唯一结果。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>来源：§2.3.1; local tagged syntax and recursion，印刷页 44–45；PDF 页 70–71。已比对相应陈述。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathbb N=\\{0,1,2,\\ldots\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PropVar},\\mathrm{BoolFml},(F_k)_{k\\in\\mathbb N}","display":false},{"tex":"x_i,\\neg\\varphi,(\\varphi\\land\\psi),(\\varphi\\lor\\psi)","display":false},{"tex":"x_i\\coloneqq\\langle0,i\\rangle,\\qquad \\mathrm{PropVar}\\coloneqq\\{\\langle0,i\\rangle:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\neg\\varphi\\coloneqq\\langle1,\\varphi\\rangle,\\quad (\\varphi\\land\\psi)\\coloneqq\\langle2,\\varphi,\\psi\\rangle,\\quad (\\varphi\\lor\\psi)\\coloneqq\\langle3,\\varphi,\\psi\\rangle.","display":true},{"tex":"F_0\\coloneqq\\mathrm{PropVar},\\qquad F_{k+1}\\coloneqq F_k\\cup\\{\\neg\\varphi:\\varphi\\in F_k\\}\\cup\\{(\\varphi\\circ\\psi):\\varphi,\\psi\\in F_k,\\ \\circ\\in\\{\\land,\\lor\\}\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{BoolFml}\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{k\\in\\mathbb N}F_k.","display":true}],"bytes":1553,"backlinks":[{"id":"2eb3efc252f058f9","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":3,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{PropVar}$ (命题变量集, see [[28-df-boolean-formula]])"},{"id":"50091c7f4fac0aab","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"ebf59bef2c973692","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}$，$f:\\{0,1\\}^n\\to\\{0,1\\}$；$\\mathrm{BoolFml}$、$x_i$ 见 [[28-df-boolean-formula]]。"},{"id":"f3bec18052244e5d","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{PropVar}$ (命题变量集, see [[28-df-boolean-formula]])"},{"id":"6f4ddd360c890dee","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{BoolFml},\\mathrm{PropVar},\\mathrm{Eval}_\\alpha$ 来自 [[28-df-boolean-formula]]、[[28-df-boolean-evaluation]]。$\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm B}$ 为 [[28-df-sat]] 固定的有效公式编码。\n$\\mathbf{FP}$ 为多项式时间字串函数类，see [[28-df-polynomial-time-function]]。$P:\\{0,1\\}^*\\to\\{0,1\\}^*$；证明是二进制字串；$c,d\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}$。"},{"id":"91bfe52ee99ebd32","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{BoolFml}$ 与 $\\mathrm{PropVar}$ 是 [[28-df-boolean-formula]] 的布尔公式集和变量集。"},{"id":"4041cfa2975b8dd1","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\Sigma=\\{0,1\\}$；$\\mathrm{BoolFml},\\mathrm{PropVar},x_i$ 见 [[28-df-boolean-formula]]；$\\mathrm{Clause},\\mathrm{CNF}$ 见 [[28-df-cnf]]；$\\mathrm{Eval}_\\alpha,\\mathrm{CNFEval}_\\alpha$ 见 [[28-df-boolean-evaluation]]。"},{"id":"e3545f8c2a4ed307","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{BoolFml}$、$\\mathrm{PropVar}$、$\\mathrm{Var}_{\\mathrm B}$ 和 $\\mathrm{Eval}_\\alpha$ 见 [[28-df-boolean-formula]]、[[28-df-boolean-evaluation]]。"},{"id":"61dee9752dab3b61","anchor":"ref-44","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"布尔问题：[[28-df-boolean-formula]]、[[28-df-boolean-evaluation]]、[[28-df-cnf]]、[[28-df-literal]]、[[28-df-clause]]、[[28-df-sat]]、[[28-df-3sat]]、[[28-thm-cook-levin]]、[[28-thm-3sat-np-complete]]。"},{"id":"525bdca973e42a63","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{PropVar}$ 是命题变量集，see [[28-df-boolean-formula]]。"}],"outgoing":[]}